{"id":"n73067-1-7","stage":2,"title":"향수 · 香水","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n73067-1-7-1","ko":"승규야, 너한테서 담배 냄새 너무 많이 나.","zh":"承奎，你身上烟味太重了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규야,","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"승규야","audio":"/audio/7df699add291e5b9b746.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"너한테서","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；한테서：口语中表示“从某人那里”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"담배","meaning":"烟，香烟","explanation":"담배：烟，香烟","readings":[{"term":"담배","audio":"/audio/10c7c905412d52542ee4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63662","senseId":"2","lemma":"담배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"냄새","meaning":"气味，味道，香味，臭味","explanation":"냄새：气味，味道，香味，臭味","readings":[{"term":"냄새","audio":"/audio/a67d0d1b921d4bc49922.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58180","senseId":"1","lemma":"냄새","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나.","meaning":"发出，泛出，响出，有","explanation":"나다：发出，泛出，响出，有；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"16","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"10c7c905412d5254","term":"담배","zh":"烟，香烟","audio":"/audio/10c7c905412d52542ee4.mp3","entryId":"63662","definition":"把晒干的烟叶切成细条用纸卷起，制成点火后供吸入其烟雾的物品。","pronunciation":["담ː배"]},{"id":"a67d0d1b921d4bc4","term":"냄새","zh":"气味，味道，香味，臭味","audio":"/audio/a67d0d1b921d4bc49922.mp3","entryId":"58180","definition":"能用鼻子闻到的味儿。","pronunciation":["냄ː새"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发出，泛出，响出，有","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"产生能察觉到的声音或气味等。","pronunciation":["나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/876d70728c585d67b9e5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n73067-1-7-2","ko":"그래? 그럼 향수라도 좀 뿌려야겠다.","zh":"是吗？那我得喷点香水了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래?","meaning":"真的","explanation":"그래：真的","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"2","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"향수라도","meaning":"香水","explanation":"향수：香水；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라도：表示让步或假定：“即使是、就算是”。","readings":[{"term":"향수","audio":"/audio/4a187426fb98765fedd2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73067","senseId":"1","lemma":"향수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뿌려야겠다.","meaning":"撒，散发","explanation":"뿌리다：撒，散发；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"뿌리다","audio":"/audio/9486f088d39eab79fc2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65867","senseId":"2","lemma":"뿌리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于对对方所说的话表示感叹或轻微的惊讶。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"4a187426fb98765f","term":"향수","zh":"香水","audio":"/audio/4a187426fb98765fedd2.mp3","entryId":"73067","definition":"喷在身体或衣服等物品上、散发香味的液体。","pronunciation":["향수"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"9486f088d39eab79","term":"뿌리다","zh":"撒，散发","audio":"/audio/9486f088d39eab79fc2b.mp3","entryId":"65867","definition":"投掷或泼洒以使其分散落在各处。","pronunciation":["뿌리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f91482fad0170dc57b58.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.495,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=73067","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":79,"sequenceScore":2.2203,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是吗？那我得喷点香水了。","这个周末，我们全家一起去户外玩怎么样？","承奎，你身上烟味太重了。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["是吗？那我得喷点香水了。","承奎，你身上烟味太重了。","这个周末，我们全家一起去户外玩怎么样？"],"answer":0}]}
